WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.280
EPISODE 15

01:40.720 --> 01:43.640
Aunt Li, open the door!

01:43.720 --> 01:45.000
Aunt Li!

01:45.880 --> 01:48.040
Who's there so late at night?

01:48.120 --> 01:50.120
It's me, Cui Rong.

01:50.200 --> 01:51.760
Hurry, open the door.

01:56.240 --> 01:57.320
What's going on?

01:57.400 --> 01:58.760
Where's Aunt Li?

01:58.840 --> 02:01.240
Who's knocking so urgently?

02:01.320 --> 02:02.800
It's Cui Rong.

02:02.880 --> 02:04.520
- Aunt Li!
- Rong?

02:04.600 --> 02:06.000
Please help my mother.

02:06.080 --> 02:08.000
She's rolling in agony on the bed.

02:08.080 --> 02:09.320
She's been in pain all night.

02:09.400 --> 02:11.000
I beg you to check on her.

02:11.080 --> 02:13.560
Me? I'm not a physician. I can't help.

02:13.640 --> 02:15.400
Chunlai, call Ms. Liu.

02:15.480 --> 02:17.520
Ask her to fetch Dr. Hu.

02:17.600 --> 02:19.880
He's great with women's ailments.

02:19.960 --> 02:22.080
He will ensure your mom's fine.

02:22.160 --> 02:24.800
I've tried, but she won't spend money.

02:24.880 --> 02:26.760
She refuses to see a physician.

02:26.840 --> 02:28.280
My dad's bedridden.

02:28.360 --> 02:31.960
If something happens to my mom,
I'll be left all alone!

02:32.680 --> 02:35.160
Please, I'm begging you. Help her.

02:36.240 --> 02:38.480
Choosing money over her life…

02:39.360 --> 02:41.520
Fine, stop crying.

02:42.280 --> 02:44.480
I'll go check on her for you.

02:44.560 --> 02:46.680
Chunlai, lock the door.

02:48.520 --> 02:52.040
Your mom's sharp tongue
has upset so many neighbors.

02:52.120 --> 02:53.840
I'm too soft-hearted.

02:54.800 --> 02:56.560
You're clever.

02:56.640 --> 02:58.160
Were you adopted?

02:58.960 --> 03:00.400
It's fine. Everything's fine.

03:07.400 --> 03:09.520
Aunt Li, she's there.

03:11.560 --> 03:14.480
At your age, you have no shame.

03:14.560 --> 03:16.640
Your daughter worries about you.

03:16.720 --> 03:18.200
You've ruined my sleep.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.960
Poor Rong. I feel sorry for her.

03:20.040 --> 03:21.640
Otherwise, I wouldn't bother.

03:22.960 --> 03:24.400
Are you listening?

03:26.600 --> 03:27.800
You okay?

03:33.600 --> 03:35.480
M-Murder. Murder! Someone died.

03:36.400 --> 03:38.960
Lady Cui, you've killed someone?

03:39.720 --> 03:40.960
Nonsense.

03:41.040 --> 03:43.680
You killed him.

03:44.840 --> 03:46.240
I won't argue with you.

03:46.320 --> 03:48.000
You're a madwoman.

03:48.080 --> 03:49.400
- What do you want?
- What?

03:49.480 --> 03:50.520
- Let me go.
- Run away?

03:50.600 --> 03:51.560
Come here.

03:51.640 --> 03:52.920
See for yourself.

03:53.000 --> 03:56.680
Isn't this Master Yan,
who your son-in-law beat to death?

03:58.560 --> 04:02.720
Don't worry, Madam. I'll deal with him.
He'll never show his face here again.

04:02.800 --> 04:05.120
Yes, we'll teach him a lesson.

04:05.200 --> 04:07.360
Even if he's dead, he deserved it.

04:07.440 --> 04:08.640
Sure.

04:08.720 --> 04:09.800
Murder.

04:17.560 --> 04:19.000
Wait here, Lady Cui.

04:19.080 --> 04:20.680
Let me speak to my mother first.

04:22.080 --> 04:23.360
Such foolishness.

04:23.440 --> 04:26.760
We're neighbors, all friendly folk.

04:26.840 --> 04:31.480
If your mom knew I was here,
she'd run to greet me.

04:32.160 --> 04:33.960
No need to go overboard.

04:34.040 --> 04:37.000
- Why are you barging in like this?
- This outfit.

04:37.080 --> 04:38.440
So beautiful.

04:38.960 --> 04:43.120
Soft, light, truly classy.

04:46.760 --> 04:47.760
Mom.

04:47.840 --> 04:50.800
Didn't I say to wait outside?

04:51.720 --> 04:52.920
This outfit,

04:54.240 --> 04:56.000
I can't get enough of it.

04:57.360 --> 05:00.520
Sister, why not just give it to me?

05:01.360 --> 05:02.480
No.

05:02.560 --> 05:04.560
This is for Mother. Not to give away.

05:08.480 --> 05:09.560
Fine, take it.

05:10.200 --> 05:11.400
Let's talk outside.

05:11.480 --> 05:12.560
Let's go.

05:13.120 --> 05:13.960
Mom?

05:14.040 --> 05:15.600
Just do your thing. Don't mind me.

05:18.200 --> 05:19.080
This way.

05:22.520 --> 05:26.360
Shouhua, Fuhui's not even showing
and you made all this.

05:29.440 --> 05:31.640
This little one's so delicate.

05:34.240 --> 05:36.280
Such beautiful embroidery.

05:36.360 --> 05:37.640
You like it?

05:37.720 --> 05:41.120
If you like it, I'll make you one too
when your good news comes.

05:43.600 --> 05:45.480
I just got married.

05:46.120 --> 05:47.520
It's too early for that.

05:50.920 --> 05:53.360
Shouhua, eager to be a mom, huh?

06:02.920 --> 06:04.200
Shouhua! Something happened!

06:04.280 --> 06:05.600
Kangning!

06:06.920 --> 06:08.960
What now? Snow in June?
Or did Sifu close down?

06:09.040 --> 06:10.760
What's shocking you like this?

06:10.840 --> 06:11.960
It's awful, just awful.

06:12.040 --> 06:14.360
Worse than any of the two you mentioned.

06:14.440 --> 06:15.720
What happened?

06:16.360 --> 06:19.000
Mom's money is missing.

06:24.920 --> 06:27.040
Hurry. If you can't find it, I'll do it.

06:27.120 --> 06:29.880
At four, I stole sweets
from under her nose.

06:29.960 --> 06:32.160
Her stash can't fool me.

06:32.960 --> 06:34.480
I've seen her sneaking around.

06:34.560 --> 06:36.560
Let's see what she's up to.

06:38.480 --> 06:39.520
Found it yet?

06:45.200 --> 06:48.200
What happened?
Last I checked, it was full.

06:49.280 --> 06:51.040
Five silver ingots, ten taels each,

06:51.120 --> 06:55.080
a gold hairpin set, two gold rings
wrapped in pink silk cloth. All gone?

06:57.520 --> 07:00.040
Qiongnu, don't tell Mom.

07:00.120 --> 07:02.000
We didn't do anything.

07:04.200 --> 07:05.280
Look.

07:12.800 --> 07:14.400
Only this wooden hairpin.

07:15.360 --> 07:17.040
We picked it up off the street.

07:18.000 --> 07:20.640
Why would she need so much money?

07:21.160 --> 07:23.240
Did Sifu House run into trouble?

07:26.760 --> 07:28.880
Big trouble's brewing.

07:28.960 --> 07:30.240
Call Fuhui back.

07:30.960 --> 07:32.760
What?

07:32.840 --> 07:36.680
The shop's full of customers.
I've got work to do.

07:37.880 --> 07:39.800
- What now?
- Sit here.

07:41.320 --> 07:43.960
Mom, the tea leaves aren't restocked.

07:44.040 --> 07:46.560
The secret tea recipes are given out.

07:46.640 --> 07:48.680
What's left to sell?

07:58.240 --> 08:01.360
Mom, where's the jade bracelet I gave you?

08:01.440 --> 08:02.680
You wore it every day.

08:02.760 --> 08:04.280
It's gone now.

08:16.560 --> 08:18.120
What is this?

08:18.200 --> 08:19.240
What do you want?

08:19.920 --> 08:22.520
My daughters,
I raised you through thick and thin.

08:23.360 --> 08:25.400
I've never enjoyed your favor.

08:25.480 --> 08:30.040
Now, you're all accusing me?

08:30.120 --> 08:31.640
How come?

08:31.720 --> 08:33.920
What's this world coming to?

08:34.000 --> 08:37.400
Raising kids is a debt.

08:38.080 --> 08:39.760
A debt.

08:39.840 --> 08:41.640
All debts.

08:43.000 --> 08:45.520
Heavens.

08:47.600 --> 08:50.480
- Mom.
- Why is my life so bitter?

08:50.560 --> 08:52.320
So bitter.

08:52.400 --> 08:54.640
Mom, you've taught us, since childhood,

08:54.720 --> 08:58.480
to save tears
for when they're truly needed.

08:58.560 --> 09:00.120
Use your strength on the blade.

09:00.200 --> 09:03.200
So, in front of us, spare them now.

09:03.800 --> 09:06.160
Speak honestly, and cry later.

09:08.760 --> 09:10.000
Fuhui.

09:17.280 --> 09:19.840
I've redeemed the pawned jewelry.

09:20.440 --> 09:22.480
Mom raised us as sons.

09:22.560 --> 09:24.960
Daughters are your only support.

09:25.720 --> 09:28.000
If you're short on money, just tell me.

09:28.720 --> 09:30.160
Why pawn things?

09:30.240 --> 09:33.480
Others will scold us
for not supporting you.

09:35.320 --> 09:38.080
No.

09:38.160 --> 09:40.120
It's just…

09:40.200 --> 09:43.480
The shop's doing poorly.

09:43.560 --> 09:46.920
The tea dues are due again,

09:47.520 --> 09:50.760
and we don't have money
to pay for that.

09:50.840 --> 09:51.960
Mom.

09:52.040 --> 09:54.560
Don't even try to lie to us at this point.

09:54.640 --> 09:56.600
You pawned so many things.

09:56.680 --> 09:58.520
Where did the money go?

09:58.600 --> 09:59.960
Yes, tell us.

10:02.920 --> 10:04.360
Well…

10:04.440 --> 10:05.520
Well…

10:05.600 --> 10:06.680
Well…

10:06.760 --> 10:09.440
I'd rather bear the burden
than worry all of you.

10:09.520 --> 10:12.080
Now look,
we're all stuck in this together.

10:12.160 --> 10:13.680
No one can escape.

10:30.240 --> 10:31.320
Fuhui.

10:40.600 --> 10:43.120
Fan, where are you going at this hour?

10:49.120 --> 10:53.360
Madam, you said it's an emergency.
What's this about?

10:58.440 --> 10:59.440
We're all family.

11:00.240 --> 11:03.360
We're in the same boat
and on the same side.

11:03.440 --> 11:04.760
Half a cup of tea's gone by.

11:05.560 --> 11:06.440
What's the big issue?

11:07.240 --> 11:08.800
Why can't you tell me?

11:12.280 --> 11:15.000
Let's wait for Chai.

11:15.600 --> 11:17.400
I'll talk to you then.

11:31.200 --> 11:33.920
Fan, why are you back?

11:34.000 --> 11:36.480
Madam, you can't blame me.

11:37.080 --> 11:40.200
Brother's horse is too fast.
He took a shortcut.

11:40.280 --> 11:43.080
We didn't even leave the city
before he caught up with us.

11:43.160 --> 11:45.640
Madam, justice always prevails.

11:46.240 --> 11:48.840
If he's the killer,
he'll be caught eventually.

11:48.920 --> 11:50.960
He can't run forever.

11:51.800 --> 11:53.440
He's reckless. Why follow along?

11:55.040 --> 11:56.120
Killer?

11:57.200 --> 11:58.520
What's going on?

12:00.160 --> 12:01.480
This is because of me.

12:01.560 --> 12:03.080
Let me explain.

12:03.680 --> 12:07.760
That day at the temple, after the ritual,
Yan returned to cause trouble.

12:08.760 --> 12:10.400
It frightened both of my sisters.

12:11.240 --> 12:15.360
Out of anger,
Fan got someone to teach him a lesson.

12:15.440 --> 12:16.880
Who knew he'd have this coming?

12:17.600 --> 12:19.000
He ended up dead.

12:19.080 --> 12:23.360
Cui used it to blackmail us,
demanding money over and over.

12:23.440 --> 12:26.960
Mom sold everything to appease her.

12:27.040 --> 12:29.160
But now, there's nothing left to give.

12:29.760 --> 12:31.400
We fear the truth might soon come out.

12:32.080 --> 12:36.240
So, we let them go
to Jiangning for safety.

12:36.320 --> 12:37.400
A lesson?

12:38.160 --> 12:39.000
What kind?

12:39.600 --> 12:41.480
A verbal scolding or physical beating?

12:41.560 --> 12:44.480
A small punishment or a brutal beating?

12:44.560 --> 12:47.600
I… I don't know.

12:47.680 --> 12:51.360
When I heard he died, my mind went blank.

12:51.440 --> 12:52.440
I can't explain.

12:52.520 --> 12:54.400
And then you let him go?

12:54.480 --> 12:56.240
Du, it's an emergency.

12:56.840 --> 12:59.200
Was he drunk? Did he fall?

12:59.280 --> 13:02.200
Did he get beaten to death?
Did he offend others?

13:02.280 --> 13:04.200
Did someone target him? Who knows?

13:05.040 --> 13:06.480
Now, there's no proof.

13:06.560 --> 13:08.840
The neighbor keeps accusing us.

13:09.360 --> 13:11.600
Should Fan die for this?

13:12.720 --> 13:13.720
That'd be an injustice.

13:14.600 --> 13:17.520
Kangning, justice isn't just words.

13:18.120 --> 13:19.200
It'll be judged in court.

13:19.280 --> 13:21.800
Only an autopsy can reveal the truth.

13:21.880 --> 13:24.480
What you did, that's aiding a fugitive.

13:25.240 --> 13:26.200
You'll be punished too.

13:29.400 --> 13:30.520
Shouhua.

13:36.480 --> 13:39.200
Fuhui. I won't go.

13:39.280 --> 13:41.880
I didn't kill anyone. I'm innocent.

13:42.480 --> 13:43.520
He was fine at the time.

13:43.600 --> 13:45.200
Someone's framing me.

13:45.280 --> 13:47.680
I'm wronged. Please help me.

13:47.760 --> 13:50.000
Brother, you have to help me.

13:50.080 --> 13:52.640
It's okay. I believe you. Don't worry.

13:55.600 --> 13:58.440
Chai, he's your family, your brother.

13:58.520 --> 14:00.560
Will you just watch him die?

14:01.160 --> 14:03.720
How can you
let his parents bury him in person?

14:05.080 --> 14:08.560
Chai, you know he's soft-hearted.

14:09.080 --> 14:10.840
Forget prison.

14:10.920 --> 14:13.560
One court trial would terrify him.

14:13.640 --> 14:14.560
Are you okay with that?

14:15.360 --> 14:17.120
I don't believe he's a killer.

14:17.640 --> 14:18.680
I'm not afraid of court.

14:18.760 --> 14:22.120
But I fear they won't find the culprit.
They might just blame him instead.

14:22.200 --> 14:24.600
That's why we hide him,
to wait and see what happens.

14:25.680 --> 14:27.520
Especially since my sister's pregnant.

14:27.600 --> 14:32.120
If anything happens to him,
it'll cost not one, but two lives.

14:34.640 --> 14:36.560
Chai, this is serious.

14:37.360 --> 14:38.320
Think it through.

14:51.000 --> 14:52.320
Well?

14:52.400 --> 14:53.600
Well?

14:53.680 --> 14:56.080
You want to report it? Go ahead.

14:57.160 --> 15:00.720
I trusted you guys to care for us.

15:00.800 --> 15:04.480
But now,
it's like cutting off our own hand.

15:05.160 --> 15:07.320
Do you think court is a safe place?

15:07.400 --> 15:10.600
They arrest first and beat later,

15:10.680 --> 15:13.560
forcing confessions at any cost.

15:17.520 --> 15:22.360
Fuhui, you're with child.

15:23.680 --> 15:24.680
Fuhui.

15:24.760 --> 15:28.080
- Mom.
- You're unlucky, like your Mom.

15:28.160 --> 15:31.240
What will you do?

15:31.320 --> 15:33.280
Widowed, with a child to raise.

15:34.080 --> 15:35.480
Fine, Madam.

15:39.880 --> 15:41.720
Kaifeng's main official seat is vacant.

15:42.640 --> 15:44.960
Acting as judge now
is Deputy Magistrate Shen.

15:45.920 --> 15:48.640
He's from Huzhou, a respected family.

15:48.720 --> 15:51.400
He's upright, boasting a good reputation.

15:51.480 --> 15:53.480
No false confessions were made in his way.

15:54.120 --> 15:55.280
Madam.

15:55.360 --> 15:57.080
I'm so miserable.

15:57.160 --> 16:01.320
My great son-in-law. It pains me deeply.

16:01.400 --> 16:02.800
Madam.

16:03.440 --> 16:06.160
- It hurts me so deeply.
- Madam.

16:07.720 --> 16:10.000
- It hurts so much.
- Chai.

16:10.080 --> 16:11.760
Honey.

16:12.520 --> 16:13.680
Chai.

16:14.880 --> 16:17.320
- Honey.
- It hurts me.

16:17.400 --> 16:18.280
Madam.

16:18.360 --> 16:19.560
Alright, enough.

16:22.280 --> 16:25.000
Fights can easily end in injury or worse.

16:25.080 --> 16:29.280
Fan Lianghan, I warned you to behave well,
not to stir up trouble.

16:29.360 --> 16:30.480
You didn't listen.

16:32.480 --> 16:36.240
Even if it was for Du,
you shouldn't have acted alone.

16:36.320 --> 16:38.040
Now, you've left us in trouble.

16:38.120 --> 16:39.560
What should Madam do about it?

16:40.280 --> 16:43.640
If there's no culprit,
they'll accuse us of hiding him.

16:43.720 --> 16:45.320
The Li's reputation will be ruined.

16:45.400 --> 16:49.720
At that time, everyone will be dragged.
Even your family and mine.

16:50.880 --> 16:51.880
And even Du.

16:52.520 --> 16:54.440
No one can escape from this.

16:54.520 --> 16:56.560
Yuanming, what do you think?

16:57.720 --> 17:01.040
Chai, after talking so much,
why is this suddenly about me?

17:01.120 --> 17:03.120
What can I possibly do?

17:10.120 --> 17:12.960
Madam, don't worry.

17:13.040 --> 17:14.280
Let me figure something out.

17:17.360 --> 17:19.120
Does Cui have any proof?

17:19.200 --> 17:20.560
Proof?

17:22.000 --> 17:23.480
The thug's body.

17:24.280 --> 17:26.080
Where did they find the body?

17:26.160 --> 17:29.720
She claimed to save him,
so she took him home.

17:30.640 --> 17:34.760
But he died before treatment.
She couldn't even save him.

17:40.320 --> 17:44.280
This street is packed with neighbors.

17:45.200 --> 17:47.800
Burying the body secretly?

17:47.880 --> 17:49.720
Impossible.

17:50.880 --> 17:52.800
Where's the body now?

17:52.880 --> 17:54.640
Still at her house.

18:10.560 --> 18:13.200
I don't want to, but if we don't comply…

18:13.280 --> 18:18.520
If she reports it,
Fan will have no defense.

18:19.880 --> 18:21.240
How much does she want?

18:21.760 --> 18:24.920
She took 100 strings of cash before.

18:25.560 --> 18:28.720
Now, she's demanding a thousand strings
in three days.

18:29.360 --> 18:30.680
Then she won't bother us again.

18:30.760 --> 18:34.480
Otherwise, she'll go to the authorities.

18:35.800 --> 18:39.840
I can raise the money, but it feels wrong.

18:39.920 --> 18:41.080
It's blackmail.

18:42.520 --> 18:44.280
Yuanming, what do you think?

18:44.360 --> 18:45.480
Should I pay her or not?

18:54.040 --> 18:55.000
I…

19:07.400 --> 19:08.440
What's wrong?

19:10.080 --> 19:11.200
When did you know this?

19:12.280 --> 19:13.160
Around noon.

19:13.840 --> 19:17.680
Fan got his wife's message
and then rushed out of town.

19:17.760 --> 19:21.480
And Chai,
I'm guessing he heard from Kangning.

19:21.560 --> 19:23.680
Everyone knew but me.

19:23.760 --> 19:25.240
I even walked into it blind.

19:26.120 --> 19:27.960
So, I'm not really part of this family?

19:28.720 --> 19:29.720
Or is it my wife?

19:29.800 --> 19:31.960
Forgot to tell me something so crucial?

19:32.560 --> 19:35.240
Concerning her husband's life,
Fuhui couldn't delay.

19:35.920 --> 19:38.480
Fan running away couldn't stay hidden.
So, Chai knew.

19:39.080 --> 19:40.920
It doesn't mean Kangning told him.

19:41.520 --> 19:45.000
But when I went there,
couldn't you just signal me?

19:45.080 --> 19:46.320
You'll know it in the end.

19:46.920 --> 19:49.200
What difference would it make?

19:49.280 --> 19:50.280
Why are you upset?

19:52.520 --> 19:54.160
You don't care about me.

19:54.240 --> 19:55.520
I don't matter to you at all.

19:55.600 --> 19:58.160
I'm just someone you keep around.

19:59.080 --> 20:00.800
Husband? What's a husband?

20:00.880 --> 20:02.720
A husband should be within your reach.

20:02.800 --> 20:03.920
You put others first.

20:04.000 --> 20:05.760
Where does that leave me?

20:06.600 --> 20:08.680
You tricked me into marriage.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.320
I'll sleep here tonight.

20:26.600 --> 20:27.680
Chou'er.

20:34.400 --> 20:36.280
Set up a new mat for him.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.200
Add a blue curtain for the bed.

20:38.800 --> 20:39.840
Sure.

21:01.040 --> 21:03.240
Someone's a bit of a jealous type.

21:03.320 --> 21:05.000
You're a bit of a jealousy monster.

21:05.080 --> 21:06.840
Even small things set you off.

21:07.640 --> 21:08.960
Take it. Just take it.

21:09.760 --> 21:12.560
We barely scraped together the silver.

21:12.640 --> 21:15.080
Now you're asking
for a thousand more in days.

21:15.160 --> 21:17.800
Even a bottomless vault would be empty.

21:17.880 --> 21:20.840
This isn't debt collection.
You're asking for my life.

21:20.920 --> 21:24.120
If you dare ask again,
I'll be skinned alive.

21:24.200 --> 21:25.160
Sell me on the market.

21:25.240 --> 21:26.960
That'd be your wish.

21:27.520 --> 21:29.320
No, no, I'm not that greedy.

21:29.400 --> 21:30.600
This is the last time.

21:30.680 --> 21:33.200
Later on, I won't ask for more.

21:35.080 --> 21:36.960
Sister, take care.

21:37.040 --> 21:38.320
Goodbye.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.800
So many treasures.

21:57.280 --> 21:59.520
Clear sky.

22:02.280 --> 22:04.800
Clear sky.

22:09.280 --> 22:11.640
Clear sky.

22:12.280 --> 22:13.680
Quick, move.

22:14.640 --> 22:17.200
Clear sky.

22:17.280 --> 22:18.320
Let's go.

22:26.440 --> 22:28.040
Seize these two thieves.

22:28.120 --> 22:29.480
- Yes.
- Thieves? What thieves?

22:29.560 --> 22:30.760
- I'm not a thief.
- Mother.

22:30.840 --> 22:32.760
- Not a thief.
- Mother.

22:34.080 --> 22:36.680
Th-Theft?

22:36.760 --> 22:38.520
Theft?

22:39.720 --> 22:43.240
Wasn't a thousand strings
enough to end this?

22:43.320 --> 22:45.960
Why change our terms all of a sudden?

22:50.120 --> 22:55.480
Madam, people's greed is endless,
like a void.

22:55.560 --> 22:57.960
Pay her now, and she'll ask again later.

22:58.760 --> 23:00.360
So, Chai and I made a plan.

23:01.440 --> 23:03.080
We'll bait her and set a trap.

23:03.160 --> 23:05.680
A bait and switch.

23:06.600 --> 23:08.640
Feign a theft and catch her red-handed.

23:08.720 --> 23:11.160
What?

23:11.240 --> 23:13.560
- This means…
- Yes.

23:13.640 --> 23:16.520
Kaifeng officers are already at her house.

23:17.200 --> 23:19.040
It's over.

23:19.120 --> 23:21.160
- It's over.
- Lianghan.

23:22.080 --> 23:24.720
It's all over, Fuhui.

23:25.360 --> 23:28.760
Calm down. Don't worry.

23:28.840 --> 23:32.120
- Let's go. Check the body.
- Help me, Fuhui.

23:32.200 --> 23:33.320
- Help me.
- Madam.

23:33.400 --> 23:34.520
This way.

23:34.600 --> 23:36.520
Do I have to go?

23:36.600 --> 23:37.560
What should I do?

23:37.640 --> 23:38.560
Of course.

23:40.200 --> 23:41.760
Don't be afraid.

23:44.040 --> 23:49.360
Kangning, stay home with Fuhui.
I'll go with Mom.

23:51.240 --> 23:52.120
Kangning.

23:55.240 --> 23:57.120
Sir, the stolen goods were examined.

23:57.200 --> 23:59.680
This jade
matches Master Chai's description.

23:59.760 --> 24:01.000
It's the same one.

24:02.200 --> 24:03.560
Of course, sir.

24:03.640 --> 24:05.760
It even bears the Chai family crest.

24:05.840 --> 24:08.800
It was for my mother-in-law,
but it ended up in a thief's hands.

24:09.440 --> 24:10.360
This isn't all.

24:10.440 --> 24:11.480
She must've hid some.

24:12.200 --> 24:13.520
- Keep searching.
- Sure.

24:13.600 --> 24:15.000
I didn't steal it.

24:15.080 --> 24:16.920
She gave it to me.

24:17.520 --> 24:20.160
Officer, the real thief is someone else.

24:20.240 --> 24:21.840
Don't wrong an innocent person.

24:22.640 --> 24:24.960
Mother, it's too hot.

24:25.040 --> 24:26.240
Let's rest in the shade.

24:27.480 --> 24:29.560
Officer, may we?

24:30.160 --> 24:31.520
Lady, free yourself.

24:31.600 --> 24:32.480
- Let's go.
- Madam.

24:33.520 --> 24:34.640
Where are you running to?

24:34.720 --> 24:36.320
Liar.

24:36.400 --> 24:38.400
Now you turn your back on me?

24:38.480 --> 24:39.880
Fine.

24:40.560 --> 24:42.360
Don't blame me for breaking my word too.

24:43.560 --> 24:45.000
Sir.

24:48.280 --> 24:50.160
Sir, the room's been searched.

24:50.240 --> 24:52.680
Just a bedridden old man,
mumbling nonsense.

24:52.760 --> 24:54.680
There's a meal and water by his bed.

24:54.760 --> 24:56.040
No other stolen goods.

24:57.680 --> 25:00.880
Lady Cui, abandoning your sick husband?

25:00.960 --> 25:02.480
Where are you going?

25:03.480 --> 25:06.480
My family's 20 kilometers from the city.

25:06.560 --> 25:09.680
An uncle celebrates his grandson's first
week birthday. We'll stay for a few days.

25:09.760 --> 25:10.920
Breaking the law, are we?

25:11.000 --> 25:12.520
Sir.

25:15.280 --> 25:16.320
Help him.

25:30.840 --> 25:31.920
What happened?

25:32.000 --> 25:33.280
I don't know.

25:34.520 --> 25:35.560
Here.

25:39.720 --> 25:40.960
There's a person there.

25:41.040 --> 25:42.640
It's a dead body!

25:42.720 --> 25:45.080
Why is there a corpse in Cui's well?

25:45.920 --> 25:47.360
I've lived here over 20 years.

25:47.440 --> 25:49.640
I've never seen such a horrifying case.

25:49.720 --> 25:50.880
A murder case!

25:50.960 --> 25:52.080
What a sin.

25:52.800 --> 25:54.200
It's her.

25:54.280 --> 25:56.800
She made her son-in-law kill.

25:56.880 --> 25:58.520
She's the murderer.

25:59.200 --> 26:00.440
You liar.

26:00.520 --> 26:02.480
How does a murder fill your well?

26:02.560 --> 26:03.960
Oh, your well has a hole, huh?

26:04.040 --> 26:05.120
Connect to my cellar?

26:05.200 --> 26:06.280
You old hag,

26:06.360 --> 26:07.240
full of lies.

26:07.320 --> 26:10.000
Not a word you say is true.
Don't trust her.

26:10.080 --> 26:11.480
Don't trust her. Fine!

26:11.560 --> 26:12.800
Officer.

26:12.880 --> 26:14.200
She's the murderer.

26:14.720 --> 26:17.440
She killed him and made me cover for her.

26:17.520 --> 26:18.960
She even promised me silver.

26:19.560 --> 26:21.280
Aside from those treasures…

26:21.360 --> 26:22.880
Here, look!

26:22.960 --> 26:25.040
All this is proof.

26:25.120 --> 26:27.200
Look at these.

26:27.280 --> 26:30.920
These were her bribes to me.

26:31.000 --> 26:33.600
The evidence is clear, Officer.

26:33.680 --> 26:37.360
I admit, I was blinded by greed.

26:38.400 --> 26:40.440
What a shame. It truly is.

26:41.560 --> 26:43.600
Don't rush. Let's see what happens.

26:44.800 --> 26:48.200
Mr. Du, a theft case turned into murder.

26:48.280 --> 26:49.960
This is no small matter now.

26:50.040 --> 26:51.800
When we deal with it later,

26:51.880 --> 26:54.240
it may offend your family.

26:54.320 --> 26:55.600
Sorry for any inconvenience.

26:56.200 --> 26:57.160
Just handle it fairly.

26:58.240 --> 27:00.440
As long as it is fair,

27:01.040 --> 27:02.320
I have no objections.

27:02.840 --> 27:06.000
Lady Cui,
this body's face is unrecognizable.

27:06.080 --> 27:07.960
Is he really Yan Zimei, the missing man?

27:08.600 --> 27:10.240
What Yan Zimei?

27:10.320 --> 27:12.120
I don't know him.

27:12.200 --> 27:16.560
She killed someone, but I don't know who.

27:16.640 --> 27:18.680
You should ask the murderer instead.

27:19.320 --> 27:23.200
Yan Zimei is a Jinshi.
He has the registry.

27:23.280 --> 27:27.080
If he's dead, returned home,

27:27.160 --> 27:30.560
or in hiding, we can check that later.

27:31.880 --> 27:36.040
As for this body,
was it beaten or murdered?

27:36.920 --> 27:38.360
We can't say yet.

27:38.440 --> 27:39.880
Murder?

27:39.960 --> 27:41.400
Don't slander us.

27:41.480 --> 27:43.680
We're innocent.

27:45.200 --> 27:47.120
Officer, we found injuries on the body.

27:47.200 --> 27:51.040
There's a head wound
and a stab to the ribs.

27:53.200 --> 27:54.200
You bastard.

27:54.280 --> 27:56.320
- My sister, just let me try.
- Let me go.

27:56.400 --> 27:57.680
Let me go!

27:58.720 --> 27:59.800
Cui Wu.

27:59.880 --> 28:01.200
- Cui Wu. You're a bastard.
- Mother.

28:01.280 --> 28:02.880
- Let her go!
- Mom!

28:02.960 --> 28:04.640
- Mom!
- Stop fighting back.

28:04.720 --> 28:05.960
Cui Wu.

28:15.240 --> 28:17.400
Let me go.

28:27.920 --> 28:30.880
Rong, do you recognize this body?

28:37.000 --> 28:39.640
Officer, are there any bruises?

28:39.720 --> 28:41.360
It's unclear.

28:41.440 --> 28:44.160
We need to take it back and do an autopsy.

28:44.240 --> 28:46.360
But this man's left leg is shorter.

28:46.960 --> 28:48.240
He's clearly a cripple.

28:49.960 --> 28:51.200
A cripple?

28:55.000 --> 28:58.080
That's clear.
Cripples aren't allowed to take exams.

28:59.040 --> 29:02.760
If this man is a cripple,
he can't be Yan Zimei.

29:03.760 --> 29:06.400
Madam, don't worry.

29:07.720 --> 29:10.960
Her adopted son, Cui Wu, is a cripple.

29:11.040 --> 29:13.440
Right, injured from gambling.

29:13.520 --> 29:15.320
This must be Cui Wu.

29:16.160 --> 29:18.720
Cui Wu? Isn't he part of her family?

29:18.800 --> 29:20.200
Looks like it. His clothes match.

29:20.280 --> 29:21.480
Indeed.

29:23.520 --> 29:25.400
It's your family who killed someone.

29:25.480 --> 29:29.440
You framed me and blackmailed me.

29:29.520 --> 29:30.640
- You're heartless!
- Madam.

29:30.720 --> 29:32.320
- Madam.
- Madam.

29:32.400 --> 29:34.200
- The law will handle them. Calm down.
- Mother.

29:34.280 --> 29:35.240
- No hitting.
- Calm down.

29:35.320 --> 29:38.320
You venomous snake.

29:38.400 --> 29:40.240
You're worse than poison.

29:40.320 --> 29:41.760
Your spit could kill someone.

29:41.840 --> 29:44.160
Even demons bow to you.

29:44.240 --> 29:45.320
- Madam.
- You're a demon!

29:45.400 --> 29:46.440
- Calm down.
- Madam.

29:46.520 --> 29:47.440
It wasn't my mother.

29:47.520 --> 29:48.600
It was me.

29:49.680 --> 29:52.840
He tried to assault me, so I killed him.

29:53.800 --> 29:57.120
Out of sanity,
my mother stole money just for me.

29:57.200 --> 29:59.840
If you want the murderer, take me.

29:59.920 --> 30:01.080
My mother didn't kill.

30:01.160 --> 30:02.480
- Shut up!
- She didn't.

30:05.080 --> 30:10.240
That thief stole my savings,
wasting it all on gambling and women.

30:10.320 --> 30:12.600
I'd die to take him with me.

30:12.680 --> 30:15.680
Even in hell, I won't forgive him.

30:15.760 --> 30:17.440
Tie me up.

30:17.520 --> 30:18.840
It's my doing.

30:18.920 --> 30:21.840
I killed him. Arrest me now!

30:21.920 --> 30:23.920
Take me now!

30:24.000 --> 30:25.640
Arrest her.

30:25.720 --> 30:26.680
Yes.

30:30.280 --> 30:31.560
No, Mom.

30:32.240 --> 30:33.360
Mom.

30:33.440 --> 30:36.120
Shouhua, I know you're a good person.

30:36.200 --> 30:39.160
I'm begging you. Please arrest me instead.

30:39.240 --> 30:41.400
Shouhua, I beg you.

30:41.480 --> 30:42.840
Shouhua.

30:42.920 --> 30:45.280
Please.

30:45.800 --> 30:46.840
Shouhua.

30:46.920 --> 30:49.680
No. She and her mother plotted the murder.

30:49.760 --> 30:54.040
And they even schemed endlessly.
Our family suffered terribly.

30:54.560 --> 30:57.800
Justice prevails. Evil meets its end.

30:58.560 --> 30:59.920
Don't let your heart soften.

31:02.520 --> 31:04.760
First time seeing you fight for a crime.

31:05.800 --> 31:07.320
Then lock them up.

31:07.400 --> 31:08.240
Yes.

31:10.840 --> 31:11.760
Madam.

31:16.000 --> 31:19.320
Mr. Du, is this solution fair?

31:20.280 --> 31:23.280
- Thank you.
- Just doing my duty. No thanks needed.

31:24.080 --> 31:27.080
Routine questions must be asked.

31:27.160 --> 31:28.840
Li family, please serve as witnesses.

31:28.920 --> 31:30.600
Mr. Du, forgive our rudeness.

31:30.680 --> 31:33.040
That would be our gratitude.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.520
You are his foster mother.

31:37.600 --> 31:38.800
He's your adopted son.

31:39.400 --> 31:41.200
A son killing his mother merits death.

31:42.000 --> 31:43.040
You're not wrong.

31:44.200 --> 31:46.160
It was accidental and unintentional.

31:46.760 --> 31:48.000
The punishment will be reduced.

31:48.080 --> 31:51.960
Be truthful in court for leniency.

31:53.960 --> 31:55.320
- Thank you, Master Chai.
- Thank you.

31:55.400 --> 31:56.520
Take them away.

31:56.600 --> 31:57.920
- Move.
- Move.

32:08.840 --> 32:10.400
They had a backup plan.

32:10.480 --> 32:11.960
Watching the Cui family in secret.

32:12.040 --> 32:15.560
She took a thousand strings to stay quiet,

32:15.640 --> 32:17.320
then fled with her daughter and the money,

32:17.400 --> 32:20.440
leaving her husband and property behind.

32:21.120 --> 32:23.280
She's clearly hiding something.

32:24.120 --> 32:25.920
A risky yet precise move.

32:26.000 --> 32:28.360
But it's like striking
a snake's weak spot.

32:29.200 --> 32:30.800
Always behaving recklessly.

32:30.880 --> 32:33.040
No wonder Fan's unlucky.

32:33.120 --> 32:34.520
Cui just killed a person.

32:34.600 --> 32:35.800
Didn't know how to treat it.

32:35.880 --> 32:38.040
Then he beat up Yan Zimei.

32:38.120 --> 32:41.640
The trouble comes along,
and Yan Zimei is even more hateful.

32:41.720 --> 32:43.320
Go home and mourn. That's fine.

32:43.400 --> 32:45.200
Just leave Bianjing and be done.

32:45.280 --> 32:47.240
Why spy on the Li family's door?

32:47.880 --> 32:49.280
His lust is still alive, clearly.

32:50.360 --> 32:52.840
He got punished but was saved by Lady Cui.

32:52.920 --> 32:56.360
When leaving, he left a bloody robe.

32:56.960 --> 32:57.880
Can you believe this?

32:57.960 --> 33:00.200
Who does such a strange thing?

33:00.280 --> 33:02.040
Was it unintentional or deliberate?

33:02.120 --> 33:04.080
Is he secretly behind Lady Cui's schemes?

33:04.840 --> 33:07.400
The Cui family's jailed, but he's clean?

33:13.240 --> 33:14.720
Don't overthink it.

33:14.800 --> 33:16.680
How could he know Cui killed someone?

33:16.760 --> 33:18.160
How could it be so coincidental?

33:19.080 --> 33:21.040
At least things are fine for now.

33:21.120 --> 33:22.400
Thank heavens.

33:23.640 --> 33:24.720
Where's Fan?

33:26.480 --> 33:29.640
That fool ran off to buy fireworks.

33:29.720 --> 33:33.840
Says he'll set them off all night
to ward off bad luck.

33:36.200 --> 33:38.640
He's so clueless and unrepentant.

33:39.160 --> 33:41.360
He'll trip up big time someday.

33:42.880 --> 33:47.360
He may be spoiled but has a pure heart.

33:47.440 --> 33:49.680
He truly cares about you
and the Li family.

33:50.400 --> 33:52.800
If he didn't see us as family,

33:52.880 --> 33:54.600
he wouldn't have stepped up.

33:55.320 --> 33:57.480
Chai is sharp.

33:57.560 --> 33:59.320
I thought he was too cunning before.

33:59.400 --> 34:04.840
I worried he'd trick my sister,
but today, he helped with Cui.

34:04.920 --> 34:06.360
He's not cold-hearted.

34:08.360 --> 34:09.800
You were right about him.

34:13.120 --> 34:14.600
You speak so wisely.

34:15.720 --> 34:17.360
But isn't your husband good too?

34:17.960 --> 34:19.080
I heard from Leshan.

34:20.000 --> 34:22.760
Even those officers are usually arrogant,

34:23.360 --> 34:28.680
and their boss is just a small figure.

34:29.400 --> 34:32.320
When they come across Du,
they still bow to him.

34:33.560 --> 34:35.160
This time, we get rid of this trouble.

34:35.240 --> 34:37.520
We can't ignore his support.

34:38.280 --> 34:41.800
With such a husband,
you're the lucky one too.

34:45.240 --> 34:52.200
Talented yet stubborn,
strategic yet impatient.

34:52.280 --> 34:54.600
I'll have my hands full later.

34:55.960 --> 34:58.040
Shouhua, guide him more gently.

34:58.880 --> 35:00.080
Don't.

35:00.160 --> 35:04.880
If he hears she praises another man,
he'll die of jealousy.

35:10.960 --> 35:14.680
The soldiers in the water fight
all looked incredibly lifelike.

35:14.760 --> 35:19.600
Even if you've never been to Jinming Pool,
it feels like you've seen it all today.

35:20.480 --> 35:23.240
We're lucky to see His Majesty's throw.

35:23.320 --> 35:27.480
In my opinion,
adding swimmers would make it better.

35:28.080 --> 35:31.120
It'd make this boat race
even more thrilling.

35:31.200 --> 35:33.760
It's all just flattery and showmanship.

35:33.840 --> 35:36.720
Trivial tricks, hardly worth mentioning.

35:44.720 --> 35:46.440
- Commander Zhang.
- Commander Zhang.

35:47.120 --> 35:48.520
- Commander Zhang.
- Commander.

35:54.960 --> 35:58.200
His Majesty says, peace across the land.

35:58.280 --> 36:03.760
Enjoy the garden
with no formalities for everyone.

36:03.840 --> 36:06.880
Relax and celebrate this peaceful time.

36:06.960 --> 36:10.040
- His Majesty's gracious.
- His Majesty's gracious.

36:13.440 --> 36:19.280
At Jinming Pool earlier,
His Majesty set a poetry challenge.

36:19.880 --> 36:21.840
He asked the Secretariat to judge it.

36:22.360 --> 36:27.080
His Majesty said,
the top winner gets a royal flower pin.

36:31.520 --> 36:36.400
Mr. Du, you're known for your modesty,

36:36.480 --> 36:39.640
but this gift is a great honor.

36:39.720 --> 36:41.840
You absolutely must not refuse it.

36:41.920 --> 36:44.240
Come, let me pin it on you.

36:45.400 --> 36:49.240
I dare not decline such kindness.
Thank you, Commander Zhang.

37:08.160 --> 37:10.200
Master, isn't it hot today?

37:10.280 --> 37:11.720
You're covered in sweat.

37:12.960 --> 37:14.000
Don't remove it.

37:15.160 --> 37:17.040
The eunuch warned against it earlier.

37:17.120 --> 37:21.400
By custom, the royal flower pin
must be taken home as it is.

37:21.480 --> 37:23.760
Breaking this rule is seen as disrespect.

37:23.840 --> 37:25.000
Pin it. Pin it now.

37:25.600 --> 37:26.600
It's okay.

37:28.960 --> 37:30.560
Wearing it is dangerous.

37:31.520 --> 37:34.040
Silk and paper flowers are fine.

37:34.680 --> 37:37.480
But His Majesty gave me this rare flower.

37:38.080 --> 37:40.720
It can't withstand any bumps or shaking.

37:40.800 --> 37:42.960
Holding it is much safer.

37:45.600 --> 37:46.800
Whose family are you from?

37:47.520 --> 37:50.200
Do you know where you are?
How dare you run around?

37:50.280 --> 37:51.960
Forgive me, masters.

37:52.040 --> 37:54.760
My master hates the heat.
He sent me to fetch ice.

37:54.840 --> 37:56.280
If I'm late, I'll get whipped.

37:56.360 --> 37:58.280
Please forgive me.

37:58.360 --> 37:59.920
Thanks a lot.

38:00.000 --> 38:00.960
Wait right there.

38:01.040 --> 38:01.920
- Lingyao.
- Hey.

38:02.000 --> 38:04.280
Forget it. It's a small matter.

38:04.920 --> 38:06.000
This is no small matter.

38:07.800 --> 38:09.480
You saw how people stared in the garden.

38:10.280 --> 38:12.040
Some envy your royal gift.

38:12.120 --> 38:14.440
Their luck's too poor to earn one.

38:14.520 --> 38:16.400
They're fuming with jealousy right now.

38:16.480 --> 38:19.560
Everyone knows you got the flower pin.

38:19.640 --> 38:22.680
If you go home without it,
someone will report you.

38:23.360 --> 38:24.480
Just wait.

38:24.560 --> 38:26.760
I'll fetch that troublemaker now.

38:26.840 --> 38:28.240
Lingyao.

38:32.200 --> 38:33.280
It's too late.

38:34.800 --> 38:36.160
Bastard.

38:36.760 --> 38:37.760
Such a bastard.

38:40.560 --> 38:42.200
My lady saw everything.

38:42.280 --> 38:46.320
Out of kindness,
she offers this flower pin to help.

38:46.960 --> 38:49.440
Well, this works out perfectly.
You can pass with this one.

38:51.360 --> 38:52.560
Thanks for your help.

38:53.120 --> 38:55.680
But we don't know each other.

38:55.760 --> 38:58.960
Though I'm in a tough spot,
I can't accept this favor.

38:59.640 --> 39:01.360
Please, take it back.

39:05.240 --> 39:07.960
When you first came to our house,
you left a poem.

39:08.040 --> 39:09.800
My lord was napping at the time.

39:09.880 --> 39:11.640
If not for my lady accepting it,

39:11.720 --> 39:15.000
asking you to wait in the study,
you'd still be waiting outside.

39:15.080 --> 39:17.720
And now, you act like you don't know her?

39:25.760 --> 39:26.720
Who's she?

39:29.000 --> 39:31.000
Plenty bring flowers and fruits here.

39:31.080 --> 39:33.680
Don't know her? Just a passerby.

39:34.520 --> 39:35.960
Who cares? Let's go.

39:37.080 --> 39:38.080
Lingyao.

39:42.720 --> 39:45.400
YU XIU'E

39:48.960 --> 39:50.440
Put this over there.

39:52.960 --> 39:53.840
My lady.

39:53.920 --> 39:55.320
They'll do these repairs fast.

39:55.400 --> 39:57.040
All will be done by noon tomorrow.

39:57.120 --> 39:58.120
Shouhua.

40:06.320 --> 40:08.360
You're home early.

40:09.280 --> 40:11.240
Aren't the flowers here growing fine?

40:11.320 --> 40:12.240
What's going on now?

40:12.320 --> 40:15.800
Madam says city food prices are steep.

40:15.880 --> 40:17.600
It's not as cozy as the countryside.

40:17.680 --> 40:21.360
My lady wants to clear a space
to build a veggie patch for her.

40:21.440 --> 40:23.280
It'll make her happy.

40:23.920 --> 40:26.160
As for these flowers, well,

40:26.240 --> 40:28.000
they'll be planted on racks instead.

40:29.200 --> 40:30.360
These flowers.

40:30.440 --> 40:32.360
Mother-in-law
had them specially moved here.

40:32.960 --> 40:36.160
For my mother,
you even uprooted your favorite flowers.

40:36.960 --> 40:38.640
- And that one.
- Runyue.

40:40.680 --> 40:42.000
Runyue?

40:43.000 --> 40:48.400
My lady said, a girl like me
shouldn't be called Chou'er.

40:48.480 --> 40:49.360
It's just not right.

40:49.960 --> 40:51.360
I was born in the leap month.

40:51.440 --> 40:53.200
I'll be called Runyue.

40:53.280 --> 40:54.280
Right, my lady?

40:57.000 --> 40:58.520
You seem so happy.

40:59.120 --> 41:01.440
I've never had a name before.

41:01.520 --> 41:03.360
My father never cared about me.

41:03.440 --> 41:05.480
Now, I finally have a name.

41:05.560 --> 41:06.920
And it's so pretty.

41:07.560 --> 41:09.680
My lady, could you call me again?

41:11.360 --> 41:13.120
Runyue.

41:13.200 --> 41:14.640
Runyue.

41:18.160 --> 41:19.440
What are you laughing at?

41:20.000 --> 41:21.160
Get back to work.

41:22.320 --> 41:24.560
My mother's used to country life.

41:25.480 --> 41:28.840
Your efforts with these flowers
show great thoughtfulness.

41:29.560 --> 41:31.120
I don't know how to thank you enough.

41:31.200 --> 41:32.680
Don't say that.

41:32.760 --> 41:35.240
We're a family. No need for such words.

41:36.120 --> 41:37.880
If you must thank my lady,

41:37.960 --> 41:40.560
why not gift the flower in your hair?

41:40.640 --> 41:42.120
Would it be better?

41:47.800 --> 41:50.720
I'll buy better flowers next time
to gift you then.

41:55.440 --> 41:56.560
Don't mind her.

41:56.640 --> 41:58.480
She was just joking.

41:59.520 --> 42:02.200
It's too hot outside. Let's go in.

42:02.280 --> 42:06.240
In the kitchen, herbal tea
and iced lychee jelly are ready.

42:06.320 --> 42:07.640
I'll bring some over.

42:08.280 --> 42:09.160
Thank you.

42:13.280 --> 42:15.480
Giving with borrowed hands?
Suits you well.

42:16.360 --> 42:18.680
Aren't you afraid of stirring up trouble?

42:19.720 --> 42:21.480
I only have one wife.

42:21.560 --> 42:23.040
What trouble could there be?

42:24.600 --> 42:25.760
Sang Yanrang.

42:25.840 --> 42:26.680
Sang Yanrang.

42:27.240 --> 42:28.520
Didn't you want to play Go?

42:41.920 --> 42:43.000
Keep it.

42:50.600 --> 42:52.240
- My lady.
- What's wrong?

42:52.320 --> 42:55.440
Look, this flower's golden center.

42:55.520 --> 43:00.040
Everyone wears flowers in the market,
but the quality's so crude.

43:00.120 --> 43:02.240
I haven't seen one this fine.

43:02.320 --> 43:05.640
Palace goods are unmatched.

43:06.400 --> 43:07.520
Look.

43:16.600 --> 43:17.640
My lady.

43:18.240 --> 43:22.600
I heard His Majesty

43:22.680 --> 43:25.320
used to visit Jinming Pool
and Qionglin Garden.

43:25.920 --> 43:29.280
The flowers gifted to officials
are often palace flowers.

43:29.360 --> 43:31.240
They were often silk or fabric.

43:32.160 --> 43:36.040
Men wear flowers for good luck.

43:37.360 --> 43:39.720
This flower is like a real lotus.

43:39.800 --> 43:40.840
Incredibly intricate.

43:40.920 --> 43:42.720
Imagine the effort it took to craft it.

43:43.440 --> 43:47.120
It seems more fit for a woman's hair.

43:48.120 --> 43:50.440
My lady, let's just keep it.

43:52.240 --> 43:53.280
Wait a moment.

44:18.880 --> 44:20.120
I've asked Lingyao already.

44:20.200 --> 44:21.400
It's just a nobody

44:21.480 --> 44:23.040
flying her flag in front of Shouhua.

44:23.120 --> 44:24.840
Du is such a scoundrel.

44:25.480 --> 44:26.720
That's not fair to say.

44:27.360 --> 44:30.320
All famous scholars,
aren't they always chasing beauty?

44:31.000 --> 44:33.920
It's like being charming is their duty.

44:34.920 --> 44:36.600
Why get jealous over this?

44:36.680 --> 44:39.280
You'll drown in jealousy your whole life.

44:40.320 --> 44:41.560
What?

44:41.640 --> 44:43.360
He wants to take concubines?

44:43.880 --> 44:46.840
How could he? Fan and Chai,
they own land and wealth.

44:46.920 --> 44:48.520
They dare to do that.

44:48.600 --> 44:49.600
He's out of control.

44:54.720 --> 44:57.400
More fragrance shops are popping up.

44:57.480 --> 44:58.600
We can't sell stuff.

44:59.280 --> 45:01.360
Mom wants to shut down our shop.

45:01.440 --> 45:02.320
What a shame.

45:02.400 --> 45:05.880
Market flowers are so coarse and gaudy.

45:05.960 --> 45:07.600
Nothing like this delicate flower pin.

45:07.680 --> 45:09.280
Why don't you design a sample?

45:09.360 --> 45:11.680
Use cheaper silk or satin instead.

45:11.760 --> 45:13.160
Pre-scent it with our fragrances.

45:14.200 --> 45:15.640
Kangning, you always get me.

45:17.840 --> 45:20.640
Scent lotus pins with lotus fragrance,

45:21.320 --> 45:23.320
osmanthus with sweet osmanthus.

45:23.920 --> 45:25.600
Peonies have no scent?

45:25.680 --> 45:28.200
How about rose or perpetual bloom?

45:28.960 --> 45:30.480
Gold threads cost too much.

45:30.560 --> 45:32.960
Switch to gold dust, silver, or beads.

45:33.040 --> 45:35.600
Make it elegant, and it'll sell easily.

45:35.680 --> 45:39.320
For this business to work,
ten or so won't cut it.

45:39.400 --> 45:42.880
Sort them by material and craftsmanship
into different tiers.

45:42.960 --> 45:46.440
That way, buyers of lower tiers will aim
for the higher ones.

45:47.200 --> 45:48.880
Ask Fuhui to discuss it.

45:48.960 --> 45:51.240
The premium ones go to the ladies
in the wealthy families.

45:51.320 --> 45:54.200
The market has silk and satin flowers.

45:54.280 --> 45:55.760
Make unique, intricate designs.

45:55.840 --> 45:57.680
In no time, they'll be everywhere.

45:57.760 --> 46:00.800
To stand out, we need a bold name.

46:02.880 --> 46:05.120
Since it uses gold and silver,

46:06.360 --> 46:08.160
let's call it

46:08.720 --> 46:10.440
Dripping Gold.

46:11.200 --> 46:13.600
Yes, Dripping Gold Flower.

46:14.440 --> 46:15.640
That's perfect.

46:19.720 --> 46:21.440
What? How much did you say?

46:21.520 --> 46:23.080
TOP-NOTCH FRAGRANCE SHOP

46:23.160 --> 46:25.080
My pearl pin is only 600 coins.

46:25.160 --> 46:27.600
Is your flower pin made of gold?

46:28.160 --> 46:29.280
- Let me see it.
- This is

46:29.360 --> 46:30.800
- a bit pricey.
- Oh.

46:30.880 --> 46:32.960
Yours uses seed pearls.

46:33.040 --> 46:35.560
Look at mine.

46:35.640 --> 46:39.040
Real gold and silver,
handcrafted, embedded so finely.

46:39.120 --> 46:40.800
Look at this craftsmanship.

46:40.880 --> 46:42.400
Eight hundred coins is fair.

46:43.520 --> 46:45.640
I'll trade one string for that.

46:46.520 --> 46:47.680
Impossible.

46:47.760 --> 46:52.080
We only make one
Dripping Gold flower a day.

46:52.160 --> 46:53.640
There are cheaper ones.

46:53.720 --> 46:56.440
Silk, satin, or brocade.

46:56.520 --> 46:59.120
They're all beautiful. Look at this one.

46:59.200 --> 47:00.040
This one's nice too.

47:00.120 --> 47:02.040
But none compare to that one.

47:02.120 --> 47:03.480
Give me one.

47:03.560 --> 47:04.600
- Yeah.
- I want one too.

47:04.680 --> 47:05.720
- Me too.
- Yeah.

47:05.800 --> 47:07.160
No.

47:07.240 --> 47:10.400
This is only one per day.

47:11.000 --> 47:13.000
But you can pre-order them.

47:13.080 --> 47:14.560
Then I'll reserve one.

47:15.400 --> 47:16.920
- Me too.
- I want one.

47:17.000 --> 47:17.920
Sure.

47:18.000 --> 47:19.680
- I want one too.
- I want one.

47:19.760 --> 47:21.120
Give me one.

47:21.200 --> 47:22.720
- I'll take one as well.
- Yes.

47:22.800 --> 47:24.920
- This one's great too.
- That one's also lovely.

49:51.360 --> 49:54.920
Subtitle translation by: Yi Yang
